  era: "1798 \xB7 Section 19 \xB7 British Expansion \xB7 1757 \u2013 1856"
  title: Subsidiary Alliance
  text: Under Lord Wellesley's Subsidiary Alliance, from 1798, Indian rulers had to keep British troops at their own cost, accept a British resident and not deal with other powers. Hyderabad was the first state to accept it.
